{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8A4A0629","title":"Saban talks life goals","entry":"Dlg_8A4A0629::entry","exit":"Dlg_8A4A0629::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_A792BE29","articyId":"72057645577540394","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Hello there. Funny seeing you in the docks. The salty smell of the water really brings you back to reality. What brings you down here?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello there. Funny seeing you in the docks. The salty smell of the water really brings you back to reality. What brings you down here?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35216","byteOffset":25682984,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_53D635AA","articyId":"72057645577540417","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"I love to explore this city! What a place. When you wonder around with nowhere in particular to go, you really could be fooled into thinking this is a good place to live.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I love to explore this city! What a place. When you wonder around with nowhere in particular to go, you really could be fooled into thinking this is a good place to live.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21595","byteOffset":16058720,"byteLength":592}},{"id":"DFr_593F3FD2","articyId":"72057645577540422","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Of course. Privacy is important. Nowhere feels as lonely, or beautiful, as the Docks. You really get a unique view of this city from here. Looking up at the belly of the beast. Almost seems like a good place to live.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course. Privacy is important. Nowhere feels as lonely, or beautiful, as the Docks. You really get a unique view of this city from here. Looking up at the belly of the beast. Almost seems like a good place to live.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37883","byteOffset":28667048,"byteLength":596}},{"id":"DFr_249759C4","articyId":"72057645577540455","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"That's great for you. This place has never felt like my home. Not for a single moment.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's great for you. This place has never felt like my home. Not for a single moment.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45812","byteOffset":31664144,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_C801ED8B","articyId":"72057645577540467","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Hey chin up. There's plenty to do in this place before we're all finished. Nivalis may be burning, but we can dance in the flames before they burn us all.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey chin up. There's plenty to do in this place before we're all finished. Nivalis may be burning, but we can dance in the flames before they burn us all.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27539","byteOffset":18300072,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_2F816FEA","articyId":"72057645577540472","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Spoken like a true Corpster. I'm happy for you. And your opportunities.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Spoken like a true Corpster. I'm happy for you. And your opportunities.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27763","byteOffset":18385920,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_637F84B5","articyId":"72057645577540490","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Getting away from my family.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Getting away from my family.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17097","byteOffset":14358672,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_8F29063F","articyId":"72057645577540503","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Because I love them.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because I love them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46855","byteOffset":32055792,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_DD3373FC","articyId":"72057645577540525","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"I do everything I'm supposed to. I work. I spend time with them. I kiss my wife and I read my kid stories at bedtime. I listen to them talk about their day.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I do everything I'm supposed to. I work. I spend time with them. I kiss my wife and I read my kid stories at bedtime. I listen to them talk about their day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3375.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47745","byteOffset":32397920,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_15BBBEF5","articyId":"72057645577540547","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"What keeps you going? We make a choice every single day, without thinking about it for even a moment, that we will continue with all of this. What's your reason?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What keeps you going? We make a choice every single day, without thinking about it for even a moment, that we will continue with all of this. What's your reason?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3975.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39978","byteOffset":29453512,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_685BE6DD","articyId":"72057645577540576","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"It's good we aren't close. You shouldn't lie to your friends.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's good we aren't close. You shouldn't lie to your friends.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33454","byteOffset":20540136,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_2B74D310","articyId":"72057645577540604","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"It was a nice talk, but I want to explore the coves. There's a nice walk near the sewage outlets. I'll see you later.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was a nice talk, but I want to explore the coves. There's a nice walk near the sewage outlets. I'll see you later.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":6075.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29833","byteOffset":19167640,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_B5EB5FD1","articyId":"72057645577540612","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"You'll figure it out. Or you won't. Hey, either way, it will be OK, you know? In the end it will all be fine. Totally fine.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You'll figure it out. Or you won't. Hey, either way, it will be OK, you know? In the end it will all be fine. Totally fine.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5500.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28301","byteOffset":18588992,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_5D28E4FB","articyId":"72057821671325230","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"No.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35673","byteOffset":27843672,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_9EFB8517","articyId":"72057645577540403","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm exploring.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":